{"stories":[{"d":"There used to be one god above them all, but the days of the Pantokrator are long gone. The very memory of his name erased from history, the backlash of his fall has eaten away most of the world, and still to this day the forces of entropy threaten its very existence. Monsters roam the land, emerging from dungeons scattered all across, stuck in a cycle of being cleared and reforming. Only the return of deities, with the blessings they confer to adventurers, allowed humankind to continue to exist, and even to thrive. But is it enough to save the future?","i":["https://cdn3.fiction.live/images/1ga13qe9s_city_of_brass_by_carloscara_d7qybf3-pre.jpg"],"likeCount":96,"ta":["fantasy","rpg","mostdicerollsbehindthescenes","notadanmachiquest","femaleprotagonist"],"cht":1790028769315,"p":72559,"isLive":true,"t":"Is it okay to accrue divinity in a dungeon?","u":[{"a":"https://cdn3.fiction.live/images/1f1vn3t4p___maria_and_pi_space_maria_drawn_by_david_liu__0f3381a28a5b7c39cb8cec01aaae5b46.jpg","_id":"GBD3f2hMx6mhHdngu","n":"magicalprincess"}],"w":1520385,"hype":1,"contentRating":"nsfw","rInteract":"medium","ut":1790199062419,"_id":"RPLW6jdhxy7ooEeiw"},{"p":12958,"isLive":true,"d":"Uh...Yo! Real talk! Can the Land of Ooo actually get more chaotic in the first place?...I guess we'll see! ","t":"Chaos In The Land of Ooo (Commission)","u":[{"a":"https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/583f9ad8-219b-4a0b-92b7-b75a7edff2e3.jpg","_id":"td6sqJHpCvq2KHMQj","n":"orz"}],"w":21837,"i":["https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/9c33f0eb-546d-43f4-ba96-48162b31340f.jpg"],"likeCount":387,"contentRating":"nsfw","ta":["adventuretime","chaosgacha","maleprotagonist"],"cht":1790198890169,"ut":1790199062394,"_id":"5dedxg3s9HXZv8Meo"},{"p":1146,"isLive":true,"d":"You can make weapons, armor, and accessories. Unfortunately, there's actually a point to it. ","t":"Speaker of Blades","u":[{"a":"https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/ef76f449-8c54-468e-af41-263d761e02d7.png","_